### 1) Calcular (salva no histórico)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rotas/calcular
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "matriz": [[0,4,7,3],[4,0,2,6],[7,2,0,5],[3,6,5,0]],
  "deposito": 0,
  "algoritmo": "HELD_KARP"
}

### 2) Comparar (salva os dois resultados)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rotas/comparar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "matriz": [
    [0, 12, 10, 19, 8, 15],
    [12, 0, 3, 7, 2, 9],
    [10, 3, 0, 6, 20, 5],
    [19, 7, 6, 0, 4, 11],
    [8, 2, 20, 4, 0, 14],
    [15, 9, 5, 11, 14, 0]
  ],
  "deposito": 0
}

### 3) Listar o histórico
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rotas

### 4) Buscar um cálculo pelo id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rotas/1

### 5) Erro esperado (404): id que não existe
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rotas/9999